# Keep the build context to source and lockfiles: dependencies are installed by `npm ci` inside the image (never copied
# from the host), and local secrets, dumps and build output never reach the Docker daemon or an image layer.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.dump
**/*.dump.*
**/*.gpg
backups
docs/load-results
